    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=-\\dfrac{13}{16}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^{4(x+1)}&=3^{\\frac{3}{4}}\\\\4(x+1)&=\\frac34\\\\4x+4&=\\frac34\\\\4x&=-\\frac{13}{4}\\\\x&=-\\frac{13}{16}\\end{align*}$$",
